{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.poi-hsis-rgu-rou-e-cod-venet-marc-299-fol-194v", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0431.11", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "V. xxvii. ΠΟΙΗΣΙΣ ΑΡΓΥΡΟΥ"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.poi-hsis-rgu-rou-e-cod-venet-marc-299-fol-194v", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0431.12", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Λαβὼν μολύβδου μοίραν αʹ, κασσιτέρου μοίρας δʺ, διὰ γῶνης γοῦν"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.poi-hsis-rgu-rou-e-cod-venet-marc-299-fol-194v", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0431.13", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ποίει · καὶ τρίψας ὀξει καὶ ἅλατι, λεύκαινε ταῦτα. Εἶτα βαλὼν εἰς"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.poi-hsis-rgu-rou-e-cod-venet-marc-299-fol-194v", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0431.14", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "κατζίον ἐν ἐλαίῳ λύε τρίς. Εἶτα ἐπὶ μοίρας εʹ τούτων βάλε ἀργύρου"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.poi-hsis-rgu-rou-e-cod-venet-marc-299-fol-194v", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0431.15", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "μοίραν αʹ · καὶ ἐνώσας διάλυε πυρί. Ἔπειτα λύων κασσιτέρου μοίρας"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.poi-hsis-rgu-rou-e-cod-venet-marc-299-fol-194v", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0431.16", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "εʹ, ἀπὸ τούτου βάλε τοῦ συνθέματος μοίραν μίαν · καὶ ὕψη αὐτὴν τὴν"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.poi-hsis-rgu-rou-e-cod-venet-marc-299-fol-194v", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0431.17", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "γύσιν τοῦ ἀργύρου."}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.poi-hsis-rgu-rou-e-cod-venet-marc-299-fol-194v", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0431.18", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ΕΤΕΡΩΣ. Λαβὼν ὑδράργυρον δυτικὸν καὶ ὑδράργυρον ἀνατολικόν,"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.poi-hsis-rgu-rou-e-cod-venet-marc-299-fol-194v", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0431.19", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἐπίσης τρίψον καὶ βάλε εἰς ὑελον, καὶ ἔψει ἐπτάκις · τὸ δὲ ἀναβαίνει"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.poi-hsis-rgu-rou-e-cod-venet-marc-299-fol-194v", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0431.20", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ὡσεὶ κρύσταλλος. Εἶτα τρίψον αὐτὸ μετὰ λευκοῦ τῶν ὤων, καὶ αὐθὶς"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.poi-hsis-rgu-rou-e-cod-venet-marc-299-fol-194v", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0431.21", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἔψει, καὶ ἀναβαίνει ὡσεὶ κρύσταλλος. Εἶτα τοῦτο λαβὼν, ποίει ἀπαιωρῶν"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.poi-hsis-rgu-rou-e-cod-venet-marc-299-fol-194v", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0432.1", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἐν τῷ σκεύει τοῦ ξέους ὡς τὸ ἄνω ῥηθέν · καὶ στάζει κάτω τὸ ὕδωρ ·"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.poi-hsis-rgu-rou-e-cod-venet-marc-299-fol-194v", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0432.2", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἐν ᾧ βαλὼν τὰ λευκὰ, ἐνθᾶψον αὐτὸ φιλοσόφως ὑέλω εἰς κόπρον ἡμέρας", "corrections": ["confusion"]}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.poi-hsis-rgu-rou-e-cod-venet-marc-299-fol-194v", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0432.3", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "μʹ, ἄχρις ἂν ὅλον γένηται ὕδωρ."}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.poi-hsis-rgu-rou-e-cod-venet-marc-299-fol-194v", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0432.4", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Τοῦτο Σολομῶντος Ἰουδαίου ἐκ τῶν ἱερῶν τοῦ ἡλίου."}
